    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Enhancing <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> Generation with Two-Stage <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>: FlashRank Reranking and Query Expansion
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=George%2C+S">Sherine George</a>
      
